<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA- RAKVERE BONDS OVERSUBSCRIBED 1.7 TIMES.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA- RAKVERE BONDS OVERSUBSCRIBED 1.7 TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rakvere Meat Factory's bond issue of 11.25 million marks was oversubscribed by 1.7 times, Uhispank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Local investors placed 19.25 million marks worth of subscriptions, Eero Sirendi of the bank's capital markets department told Reuters.</p>
<p>Rakvere will issue bonds on Monday to finance its acquisition of the majority of shares in Latvia's Rigas Miesnieks.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
